# v1.5.4: the release keystore is PRIVATE — GitHub Actions decodes it from
# the PV_KEYSTORE_BASE64 secret into android/keystore/ at build time. Never
# commit a keystore here again: the previous publicly-committed key had to
# be retired because its identity carried a cached Play Protect verdict.
android/keystore/

# the bundled web export (CI builds it via scripts/prepare-android-assets.mjs)
android/app/src/main/assets/
